  "details": "Currently many gun assets use the GestureWeight parameter for the trigger. While this works on Index controllers. GestureWeight is mapped to the grip button on quest controllers. Personally i'd like to see this be more consistent across controllers. \n\nmany creators I've mentioned this to have no idea that's how it works. And are surprised and often frustrated that this limits them. \n\nSo my suggestion is either having a consistent GestureWeight parameter for only the trigger. \n\nOr adding a new parameter and renaming the old one, so we could have: TriggerWeight L/R. And GripWeight L/R.\n\nPersonally i see more value in the second option, as suddenly changing GestureWeight might ruin systems where you squeeze something etc. As well as giving creators more options for creativity.",
